              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ēloquentia, ēloquentiae — \"eloquence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ēloquentia eius iūdicēs mōvit. His eloquence moved the judges."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ēloquentia, ēloquentiae f. Built on ēloquēns, speaking out well. English eloquence."
            }
